[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13980.67, "timestamp": "03:53:00", "text": "有人接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13983.99, "timestamp": "03:53:03", "text": "接受我，甚至还要继续关注我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13985.83, "timestamp": "03:53:05", "text": "这就是为什么它超级棒的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13988.87, "timestamp": "03:53:08", "text": "看到他们得知真相，真是令人尴尬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13990.67, "timestamp": "03:53:10", "text": "他们确实在监视我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13992.269, "timestamp": "03:53:12", "text": "有时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13994.87, "timestamp": "03:53:14", "text": "但我很高兴他们至少是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13996.79, "timestamp": "03:53:16", "text": "遵守规则，就像你知道的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13999.15, "timestamp": "03:53:19", "text": "保持我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14002.309, "timestamp": "03:53:22", "text": "praashi 我的身份和我的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14004.55, "timestamp": "03:53:24", "text": "秘密，比如不透露或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14009.03, "timestamp": "03:53:29", "text": "什么事我都跟他们提过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14012.229, "timestamp": "03:53:32", "text": "尤其是在 Instagram 之前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14015.59, "timestamp": "03:53:35", "text": "接下来，我将以 YouTuber 的身份加入 Dark Next。我以前不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14016.349, "timestamp": "03:53:36", "text": "触碰"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14018.469, "timestamp": "03:53:38", "text": "Instagram。我以前用的是旧款"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14022.87, "timestamp": "03:53:42", "text": "运动型男的Instagram。所以我有了我以前的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14026.309, "timestamp": "03:53:46", "text": "同学什么的，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14029.269, "timestamp": "03:53:49", "text": "所以我不得不把它们全部清除掉，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14031.83, "timestamp": "03:53:51", "text": "喜欢看的人可以在我的故事里看到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14034.469, "timestamp": "03:53:54", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。我不得不亲自私信他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14038.15, "timestamp": "03:53:58", "text": "喜欢我，我就会告诉他们你"}, {"